        "message": "Update marketing data with a full review pass of all 71 platforms\n\nSeven review agents re-checked every platform record and wrote setup\nsteps; 233 corrections merged (e.g. YouTube upload quota bucket, X\npay-per-use details, Pinterest token lifetimes, Instagram limits,\nWeChat publish restrictions, Messenger has no posting API).\n\n- SETUP.md / data/setup.json: human steps, secrets, agent steps, test\n  call and notes for all 71 platforms and 10 hubs (Buffer, Postiz,\n  Ayrshare, Publer, Metricool, Later, n8n, Zapier, Make, IFTTT)\n- PLATFORMS.md, LOGIN.md, README.md, AGENT-GUIDE.md regenerated from the\n  merged data\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
