        "message": "Detailed setup steps for every platform and hub\n\nNine agents rewrote all 81 setup entries (71 platforms + 10 hubs) to one\nstandard: prerequisites; 8-15 human steps with exact URLs, menu paths,\nfields and confirmation checks; secrets with where to find each one;\nagent steps with HTTP method, URL, headers and body examples, media\nupload, scheduling, token refresh, limits and idempotency; a test call;\ntroubleshooting table; alternative route. Platforms without a posting API\nget content specs, native-scheduler or import steps, and what the agent\nprepares.\n\nRecord fixes: VK wall posting needs a user token (community tokens\ncan't call wall.post); Pinterest refresh tokens are 60-day continuous.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
